<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>This<sp/>example<sp/>puts<sp/>the<sp/>device<sp/>into<sp/>STANDBY<sp/>mode.<sp/>If<sp/>the<sp/>lowest<sp/>possible</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>current<sp/>consumption<sp/>in<sp/>STANDBY<sp/>mode<sp/>is<sp/>desired,<sp/>the<sp/>JTAG<sp/>connector<sp/>must</highlight></codeline>
