<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>This<sp/>pin<sp/>must<sp/>be<sp/>pulsed<sp/>by<sp/>an<sp/>external<sp/>agent<sp/>for<sp/>wakeup.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
