<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>GPIO0<sp/>needs<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>pulled<sp/>low<sp/>to<sp/>wake<sp/>up<sp/>the<sp/>device.</highlight></codeline>
